# silently, and the storage census could not see the file at all. Removed in
# D334; this keeps the surface, and the ConfigManager wiring that reached it,
# from coming back by accident.
npx tsx scripts/check-capability-activation-single-authority.ts || exit 1
npx tsx scripts/check-no-heap-dump-command.ts || exit 1
# D718: no heap-snapshot env and no event-fanout mode switch (always filter).
npx tsx scripts/check-no-retired-fanout-heap-env.ts || exit 1
# The container-child precedence is defined once and copied twice, by two
# consumers that cannot import it (the viewer resolves @camstack/types from its
# own node_modules; the HA provider expresses it over the DeviceType enum). A
